{"4238690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duolty", "steam_appid": 4238690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duolty</strong> is a surreal <strong>mystery RPG</strong> focused on exploration, puzzles and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fractured world where reality blends with <strong>dreamlike logic</strong>. Explore unique, interconnected areas, solve varied puzzles, and meet strange, <strong>memorable characters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the experience, leading to multiple endings and hidden content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, you will face <strong>a deep, psychological story</strong> about identity and human fragility, where you won’t just explore a strange world… but your own place within it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamlike, interconnected worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden rooms and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles with varied mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your actions and discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal, narrative-driven experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange, memorable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling yet charming atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights — but not your typical ones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duolty is a deeply personal, <strong>single-developer project</strong> with a strong narrative core and an original soundtrack, designed for players who enjoy surreal, introspective experiences.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duolty</strong